Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[Thunder Rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.67,0:00:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[Rain Pattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[Birds Chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[Woman] \NOur world was much larger then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest went on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.27,0:01:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We tree spirits nurtured the harmony \Nof all living things,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but our closest friends were humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, as sometimes happens, \Nthe balance of nature shifted, \N[1812 Reset / MudFlood]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and Hexxus... \Nthe very spirit of destruction...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.09,0:01:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,rose up from the bowels \Nof the earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and rained down his poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.67,0:01:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest was nearly destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Many lives were lost, \Nand the humans fled in fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,never to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.85,0:01:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Most think they didn't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only by calling up \Nthe magical powers of nature...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that I was able to trap Hexxus \Ninside an enchanted tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and save FernGully.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why it is so important \Nfor you to learn to use these powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be around forever, \Nand you'll have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Crysta?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.71,0:02:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why it is so important \Nfor you to learn the secrets of...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.97,0:02:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,♪[Rhythmic]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Crysta! \N- Magi, yes. The secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. But, I mean, \Nit's all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so long ago, and you trapped \Nhim in that tree and everything, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I really have to go now, \Nbut I'll see you later, okay? Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,♪[Continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey! \N- Pips.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you're spending more time \Nwith Magi than you do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what can I learn from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey! \N- ♪ When the sleepy planet comes alive ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.32,0:03:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪And I wake up \Nin the warm sunlight ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ There's a simple harmony \Nto life ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,♪A magic thing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Then I walk among \Nthe flowers and trees ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Ock. Hi, Rock. \N[Giggles]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Both Squawking] \N- ♪And I feel the earth beneath my feet ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,♪And I remember that \Nthe air we breathe ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Is a magic thing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.31,0:03:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Everybody, now \NLife is a magic thing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.19,0:03:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Yeah, yeah ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[Slurping, Grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- ♪Life is a magic thing ♪ \N- [Protesting, Yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Comin' through! Watch out! Here I come! \N- ♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Life is a magic thing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Yeah, yeah Yeah ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Life is a magic thing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There she goes. \NCome on. Don't lose her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.99,0:04:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay. \N- Crysta, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[All] Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.57,0:05:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Never, never go above the canopy. \NNever go above the canopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Crysta!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Crysta!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[Gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Screeching] \N- [Screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- I got ya. \N- [Gasping, Panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy, going above the canopy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we was almost falcon fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've got to tell Magi. \N- Tell Magi what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.11,0:06:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What'd you see... \Nup there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Halt! Who goes there? \N- Hi, Crysta!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, what's the password? \N- Oh, come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that the password? \N- It sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye. \N- "Bye." That's it! That's the password!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know if that's the \Npassword or not. I'm so confused, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.39,0:06:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Magi? Magi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Magi, I just saw the most \Nincredible thing above the canopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole other world. \NThe sky went on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And way over in the distance \Nas far as I could see,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,there was this enormous rock like a...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:07:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mountain. \NThat was Mount Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And next to it was a... a... \NI don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It looked like a strange black cloud \Nrising out of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.67,0:07:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Smoke, I should think. \N- What's smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there are many things in our world \Nyou don't yet know about, Crysta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.43,0:07:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There are worlds \Nwithin worlds, Crysta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything in our world is connected by \Nthe delicate strands of the web of life,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,which is balanced \Nbetween forces of destruction...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.57,0:07:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and the magic forces of creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Help it grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.43,0:07:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.98,0:08:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone can call on \Nthe magic powers of the web of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to find it in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to, Magi. \NYou know I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was thinking about that smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think \Nit could be... Hexxus?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there isn't a force in \Nnature that could release him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and there are no poisons here \Non which he can feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hexxus is trapped for all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- But what could have caused the smoke? \N- Now, now, now, off with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Magi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hexxus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[Chittering, Squawking]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,♪[Pan Pipes]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So what did the Mag have to say, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- She said I should get serious. \N- 'Bout time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and stop hanging around \Nwith bug-brained layabouts like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Red light. \NRed light again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Immediate clearance requested! \NImmediate clearance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no! \N- Where you goin'? Crysta!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.09,0:09:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[Muffled Yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[Continues Yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bless your heart with magic light. \NI give the gift of fairy sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sighs] Oh, what a strange little bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Gravity works.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[Thump]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.77,0:10:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Primary testing laboratory. \NNo! Pass the probe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Graduate students, \Nall gather forward. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Love the haircut. \N- [Screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right. \NWe won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's still a little confused. \N- Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.95,0:11:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, I'm a nocturnal \Nplacental flying mammal,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,a member of the family of pteropodidae, \Nor Ptero-didn't I. [Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't tell, I'm a bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am. And they used to \Ncall me "Batty," Batty Koda.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Pleased to meet you. Bonjour. \N- [Giggles]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I just blew in from a biology lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back, and I'm flappin' free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.47,0:11:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you a story, \Nand it's all about...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,♪[Techno Horror]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.07,0:11:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Yo, the name is Batty \NThe logic is erratic ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Potato in a jacket \NToys in the attic ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I rock and I ramble \NMy brain is scrambled ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Wrapped like an animal \NBut I'm a mammal ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.71,0:11:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our cosmetics \Nare non carcinogenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I've been brain-fried, electrified \Ninfected and injectified ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Vivisectified \Nand fed pesticide ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ My face is all cut up 'cause \Nmy radar's all shut up ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Nurse, I need a checkup \Nfrom the neck up I'm Batty ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.93,0:12:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems to have no effect, Doctor. Get me \Nanother one. Get me another animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ They used and abused me \NBattered and bruised me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.81,0:12:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Red wires, green wires \NStuck 'em right through me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ So hear my batty word and \Nexercise a little prudence ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.86,0:12:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ When dealing with... humans ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.78,0:12:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Humans? \N- [Screaming] Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,N-N-N-No! \N[Imitating Ricky] Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, there are no humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- They're long gone. \N- Vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- They only exist in stories. \N- [Sniffing]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[Slurps, Belches] Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, charming. \N- It's been lovely, but I gotta "hoon".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios, amigos! \NDing! Check, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[Grunting, Groaning] Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.65,0:13:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Father, \Ndo you think it's possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Could humans still exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.99,0:13:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Crysta. Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.95,0:13:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're a little old \Nto believe in human tales?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Human tails? \NHumans don't have tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They have big, big bottoms \Nthat they wear with bad shorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They walk around going, \N"Hi, Helen!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sniffs, Slurps]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really see humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Were they at Mount Warning? \N- Oh, masses of Homo sapiens. [Chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! \NWhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.28,0:13:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this territory \Nlooks kinda familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fabulous day in the canopy, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where do you think you're goin'? \N- Mount Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[Groggy] I know where I am. \NI know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You scared me there. For a minute I thought \Nyou said you were going to Mount Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.67,0:14:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- But there are humans on Mount Warning! \N- Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Fractured fig, fairy bug! \NCome on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mount Warning is the last place in the \Nworld a little bug like you wants to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at these! \NYou think nature did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I put this in \Nto get better reception?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Humans did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.07,0:14:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We should stay here. \NIt's nice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.91,0:14:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! You got a great set of wings. \NLet's just flutter for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Whimpering] \N- Batty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Batty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.22,0:14:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- My heart! Oh, my heart! \N- [Gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go on. Help me! \NMy little wings can't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should wait here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a fabulous idea. \NI really think we should fly with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Only, why don't you stay here with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, really. \NI'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I not believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.41,0:16:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[Giggles]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[Moaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[Gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.89,0:16:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Take anything you want. \NI won't tell the cops. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you all right? \N- [Yells] I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is going on here? \N- The monster... it tried to eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.98,0:16:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Monster? \N- My friend and I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Batty. Batty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sonic interference. \NWhat a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I saw a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[Yells] Human!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[Gasps] That's a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:17:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Kill it! Restrain it! \NMedicate it! Something!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[Inhaling] \NPuff up. They hate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Yelling] \N- [Screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Back! Back! \NGet back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't worry! I've got it scared. \N- No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- I have but one claw, but beware. \N- Will you both just calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[In Unison] He tried to kill you! \NI did not! You did!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.95,0:17:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on! The only thing \Nthat tried to kill anybody...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.75,0:17:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,was that horrible monster \Nin the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Monster"? What monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.38,0:17:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The one that ate the tree. \NIt was terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.05,0:17:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.55,0:17:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The leveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, am-am I dead? \N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.47,0:17:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We could fix that for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then I must be dreaming. \N- Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, sure. And what are you \Nsupposed to be... some kind of fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am. What about you? \NAre you really a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.15,0:17:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.82,0:18:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, fairy, it's been weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm outta here, \Nthis dream is history.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.50,0:18:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[Yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sighs, Grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[Continues Yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[Yelling Becomes Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[Whooping]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[Laughing, Whooping Continue]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[Yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.90,0:18:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[Laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Check this out. \N- [Yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.32,0:18:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I've a basic inclination ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Whimpering] No. No. \N- ♪ A very primal need ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.12,0:18:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[Yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.29,0:18:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ To inspect the vegetation ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ For an egg or centipede ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I just can't control \Nthis hunger ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,♪I just can't seem \Nto cut it back ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ On my ravenous consumption ♪ \N[Grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ You're a welcome little snack ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ If I'm gonna eat somebody ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.74,0:19:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- ♪ It might as well be you ♪ \N- Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Can you dig it ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I can see you as a sandwich ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Or a strange exotic stew ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.04,0:19:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[Chorus] \N♪Floating down the river ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.84,0:19:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- ♪ Like an oyster in a stew ♪ \N- ♪ Get funky one time ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ He's gonna eat somebody ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.89,0:19:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- ♪It might as well be you ♪ \N- [Yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ You know it \NKick it one time ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Yelling] \N- ♪ Mmm ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Welcome to the food chain ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:20:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No! You can't eat him. \NHe's a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.32,0:20:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Uh, what's a human? \N- [Yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious and nutritious. \NTastes just like chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.91,0:20:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.95,0:20:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's my friend. \N- [Sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, any friend of a fairy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Yelling] \N- Is a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man. You owe me \Na free dinner after this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay? \N- [Screams] What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- I-I-I'm three inches tall! \N- Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- I shrank you. \N- You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was the most amazing thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's not what the spell \Nis really supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But Magi Lune will fix you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You shrank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.07,0:20:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. \N- Catches on quick, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- We better buzz off. It's getting late. \N- "Buzz off'?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not buzzing anywhere. \NNow, unshrink me, and I mean now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, I guess I could take a bash at it. \N- "Take a bash"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm just sort of learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! I've been shrunk \Nby an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this. \NOkay, come on. Bash away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! \NWhat was done, now undo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.93,0:21:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Return you to the form that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[Grunts, Moans]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, big ears. \NElephant! No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.15,0:21:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anteater! Orangutan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, let me guess. A duck! \NA duck! Oh, it's Darwin's grab bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.86,0:21:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Zak Panting] \N- Uh, let me try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes! \N- No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but I think maybe \Nwe better go see this Magi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.38,0:21:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Zak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.38,0:21:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm Crysta. \N- Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.34,0:21:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to love FernGully.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the most beautiful, \Nwonderful place in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come on. \NBatty can carry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.39,0:22:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Moi? Uh-uh. \NNot this little mammal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.69,0:22:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly a human? \NI'd rather suck wax fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.83,0:22:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Crysta!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Crysta! \N- Whoa! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.13,0:22:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Any sign of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.71,0:22:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back. \NShe's probably back home havin' dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, or she's somebody else's dinner. \N[Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.26,0:22:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She's fine. \NNow, keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.35,0:22:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're lookin', we're lookin'. \N- Okay, yeah, we're lookin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're lookin'. What are we lookin' for? \N- Look at us look. We're lookin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.61,0:22:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that what we're lookin' for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.49,0:22:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.37,0:23:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[Crysta] \NWhat are the trees like where you live?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.46,0:23:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like this. \NI live in a city.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.09,0:23:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"City"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.42,0:23:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... buildings,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.76,0:23:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,traffic, roads,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.47,0:23:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,lights... a city.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.89,0:23:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Most humans live in cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.19,0:23:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's not many trees there. \N- But how can you live without trees?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.69,0:23:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Easy. \N- But trees give life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They make the clouds, \Nthe rain, the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.11,0:23:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got air.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if you don't mind getting \Nall your minerals in one breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.78,0:23:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[Coughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.78,0:23:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you miss talking to the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.12,0:23:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't say I've actually \Ntalked with a forest before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.96,0:23:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I do all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.29,0:23:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[Chuckles] What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.80,0:23:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪It's raining like magic ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.26,0:23:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,♪It's falling like starlight ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,♪It's raining like magic ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:23:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,♪It's raining life ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.98,0:24:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ The forest is breathing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.23,0:24:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,♪And ferns are rejoicing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ The trees are all singing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.07,0:24:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Hey, it's raining life ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.73,0:24:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[Chorus] \N♪Raining like magic ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,♪La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la \NIt's raining life ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.29,0:24:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So what about you, Crysta? \NI mean, what do fairies do anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.58,0:24:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- "Do"? \N- Yeah, I mean, do you have jobs or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.17,0:24:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What-What's a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.80,0:24:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that answers that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.55,0:24:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, um, what do you do all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.76,0:24:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mm, help things grow. \N- Yeah? That sounds cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.14,0:24:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, usually it's warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.22,0:24:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, no. Cool means hot. \N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.85,0:24:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You know... \Nbodacious, bad, tubular.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.69,0:24:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome use of the language, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.07,0:24:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As in,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.40,0:24:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"You are \None bodacious babe."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.15,0:24:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's good. \NI mean cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.74,0:24:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Zak] Yeah. We're communicating now. \N- [Snoring]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.03,0:25:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Zak] Yeah. We're communicating now. \N- [Snoring]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.70,0:25:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[Crysta] Tubular.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[Chopping]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.09,0:25:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[Chopping Continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.89,0:25:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.73,0:25:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Gasps] \N- What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.73,0:25:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Carving your name. \NSee? C-R-Y-S...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.73,0:25:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, you mustn't do that. \NHere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.78,0:25:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can't you feel its pain? \N- "Its pain"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.45,0:25:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[Crysta] \NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.70,0:25:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans can't feel anything... \Nthey're numb from the brain down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.24,0:25:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Zak.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.37,0:25:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.04,0:25:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.17,0:25:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I say something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.59,0:26:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, which way to FernGully?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.81,0:26:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Grunting] \N- Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.40,0:26:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.58,0:26:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[Zak Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.58,0:26:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this great?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.25,0:26:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.09,0:26:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is this place? \N- This is FernGully.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.39,0:26:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[Yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.14,0:26:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Crysta, what's this? \N- [Yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.77,0:26:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, Stump. \NHe's a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.48,0:26:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey! \N- Hey, how does it taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.24,0:27:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- A "hoo-man"? \N- Is this what we're lookin' for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.24,0:27:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let go of me! \N- [Yells, Indistinct]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.29,0:27:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Crysta! \N- Hey, that's my human!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.50,0:27:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.92,0:27:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.13,0:27:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm blind! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.22,0:27:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see! \NIt's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.22,0:27:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Another perfect landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No worries. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.98,0:27:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you for caring. It's just a few bruises. \N- [Chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.61,0:27:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nobody cares about me. \N- I do, bat man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.94,0:27:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- You sure? \N- I'm positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.91,0:27:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Only fools are positive. \N- Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.32,0:27:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm positive. I fell for it! \N- [Chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.66,0:27:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- I should have known! \N- Come on, Zak.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.75,0:27:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Crysta, we were so worried about...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.83,0:27:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's that? \N- Father, I'd like you to meet Zak.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.84,0:28:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi. \N- He's a bodacious babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.30,0:28:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- A what? \N- He's a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.60,0:28:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[All Gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.26,0:28:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[All Chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.85,0:28:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow I thought they'd be... \Nbigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.77,0:28:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I had a little accident, \Nand he sort of shrank.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.74,0:28:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But just think... \Nhumans back in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.07,0:28:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, there goes the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Be nice, Batty. \N- First thing, all these trees go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.66,0:28:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then come your highways, then come your \Nshopping malls and your parking lots...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.08,0:28:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and your convenience stores, \Nand then come...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.58,0:28:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Price check on prune juice, Bob. \NPrice check on prune juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.42,0:28:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Crysta! Where you been? \NI've been looking all over for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.14,0:28:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pips, you won't believe what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.51,0:28:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't he amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.48,0:28:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we be charging \Nadmission for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.06,0:28:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all you've got to say? \NI been out all night,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.73,0:28:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and you want to show me \Nthis weird creature here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.07,0:29:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This "weird creature" is a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.74,0:29:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. He's kinda small, \Nain't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.58,0:29:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Whistles] \N- [All Shouting] Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.75,0:29:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[All Gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.43,0:29:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Pips, why don't you tell us \Nabout your strange treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.10,0:29:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Well, \Nit's simple, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard like stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.27,0:29:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,yet, uh... yet it's hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.11,0:29:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And, uh, yeah, it has this, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.61,0:29:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,it has this little vine \Ncoming out of it and... and...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.07,0:29:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my stereo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.82,0:29:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I found it, \Nso I'll explain it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.87,0:29:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. \NThen what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.33,0:29:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, it's obviously, um... \N- [Fairies] Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.79,0:30:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, it's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.80,0:30:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Music] [Rock] \N- [Zak] Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.22,0:30:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's alive! \N- And it's noisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.10,0:30:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a recording of music.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.89,0:30:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know \Nwhat a recording is,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.06,0:30:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know what music is, \Nand that is not music.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.82,0:30:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- ♪ Come on, everybody, gather 'round ♪ \N- Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.36,0:30:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Na, na-na-na-na na-na-na-na, \Nna-na-na na-na-na ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.41,0:30:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- ♪Na-na-na-na ♪ \N- ♪I need somebody to help me Come on ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.20,0:30:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Na, na-na-na-na \Nna-na-na-na ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.04,0:30:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock out, fairies! \NCome on! Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.46,0:30:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.46,0:30:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ You gotta know how to pony \Nlike bony maroni ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.26,0:30:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Audio pollution! Oh! Oh! \N- ♪Hot potato ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.43,0:30:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Do the alligator ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.26,0:30:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Put your hands \Non your hips, yeah ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.81,0:30:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Let the backbone slip ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:31:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Do the Watusi ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.56,0:31:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ With my little Lucy ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.65,0:31:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- ♪ Come on ♪ \N- Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.15,0:31:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Na, na-na-na-na na-na-na-na, \Nna-na-na na-na-na ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.99,0:31:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Na-na-na-na ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.99,0:31:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Na, na-na-na-na na-na-na-na, \Nna-na-na na-na-na ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.91,0:31:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Na-na-na-na ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.00,0:31:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.59,0:31:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ It sure feels good, yeah \NLike I knew it would ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.92,0:31:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Feel all right, yeah ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.47,0:31:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ You know \Nway down in the alley ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.76,0:31:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- ♪ Long, tall Sally ♪ \N- Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.02,0:31:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Twistin' with the new thing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.10,0:31:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Doin' the Watusi ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.32,0:31:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Roll over on your back, yeah ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.44,0:31:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,♪I like it like that ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.70,0:31:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Push it through the jerk ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.70,0:31:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- ♪ And then watch me watch me work ♪ \N- Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.16,0:32:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me and the boys. \NWe'll give you a taste of real FernGully wildlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.41,0:32:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, \Nyou're not up to it, "Zap."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm up to anything you can dish out, bud. \N- [Growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.13,0:32:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.97,0:32:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not now, Pips. \N- Nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.09,0:32:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on, Zak. \N- Hey! Hey, where they goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.77,0:32:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,See you around, "Zag."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.15,0:32:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[Zak Sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.62,0:32:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[Giggling]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.44,0:33:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Anytime you want ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.48,0:33:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ To be right here ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.40,0:33:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Just imagine me ♪ \N[Giggling]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.74,0:33:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,♪And all this will appear ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.03,0:33:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ You can keep this moment ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.33,0:33:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,♪All your life \Nforever near ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.29,0:33:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Zak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.29,0:33:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,♪A dream worth keeping ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.05,0:33:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ When you're feelin' lost ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.39,0:33:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,♪I'll be your star ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.18,0:33:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Just reach out and touch me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.56,0:33:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- ♪No matter where you are ♪ \N- [Giggling]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.44,0:33:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,♪In a world \Nwhere precious things ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.44,0:33:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Are disappearing overnight ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.53,0:34:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Just keep my star in sight ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.49,0:34:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,♪I believe ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.12,0:34:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ We've found the dream ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.08,0:34:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ That we're keeping ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.50,0:34:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,♪For more than just a day ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.38,0:34:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,♪And even though ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.39,0:34:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ The winds of change ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.39,0:34:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,♪May come sweeping ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.23,0:34:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪It's still a dream \Nworth keeping ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.19,0:34:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,♪So don't let it ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.19,0:34:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Fade away ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.03,0:34:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Someday you might \Nbe thinking ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.08,0:34:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ That life has passed you by ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.58,0:34:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Your spirits \Nmight be sinking ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.21,0:34:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ With hope in short supply ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.92,0:35:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,♪And that's the reason why ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.64,0:35:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ That's the reason why ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.27,0:35:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- ♪I know your dream's worth keeping ♪ \N- [Giggling]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.82,0:35:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,♪As long as it will stay ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.94,0:35:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Even when you see ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.07,0:35:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ The darkness come creeping ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.12,0:35:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,♪A dream worth keeping ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.38,0:35:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Will never fade away ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.64,0:35:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I better go find \NMagi and get you unshrunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.22,0:35:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's no hurry. \N- No, I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.14,0:35:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it wait till tomorrow. \NCome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.61,0:35:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I've got to tell her \Nabout you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.40,0:36:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait here. I'll be back \Nas soon as I can find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.67,0:36:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, what's goin' on, Zak? \N- What are you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.34,0:36:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You know exactly what I'm \Ntalkin' about... the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.05,0:36:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know what's happening, don't you? \N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.18,0:36:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea. Ask the human. \NHe may know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.10,0:36:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Uh, Crysta... \N- You lied to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.22,0:36:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[Stammering] \NI-I... Crysta...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.78,0:36:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish... I wish \Nthe human tales were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.74,0:36:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not here \Nto protect the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.08,0:36:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're cutting down trees. \NThey're destroying the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.37,0:36:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[All Gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.08,0:37:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was helping them do it. \NBatty was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.30,0:37:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- I was? \N- They're coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.13,0:37:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop them. \NYou'll have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.19,0:37:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The humans have released Hexxus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.24,0:37:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather everyone in the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.70,0:37:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Zak, truth doesn't \Nalways win friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.79,0:37:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but it certainly influences people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.38,0:37:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not half bad for a hominid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.26,0:37:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sobbing]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.15,0:38:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.83,0:38:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Magi] Since the beginning of time, \N- Oh, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.58,0:38:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been the guardians \Nand the healers of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.05,0:38:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We have too long forgotten \Nthe magic powers of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.18,0:38:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come \Nto call on them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.48,0:38:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember: \NAll the magic of creation...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.85,0:38:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,exists within a single tiny seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.78,0:38:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[Thunder Rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.78,0:38:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,♪[Vocalizing]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.60,0:39:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,♪[Vocalizing Continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.85,0:40:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We must go to Magi.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.82,0:40:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for the hero \Ninside yourself, Crysta.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.24,0:41:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look to the good and loving heart \Nin you and all others.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.91,0:41:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,For just as every seed holds \Nthe power and magic of creation,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so, too, do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.17,0:41:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and every other creature \Nin this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.84,0:41:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,♪[Vocalizing Continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.01,0:41:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Magi, don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.35,0:41:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.97,0:41:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be with you. \N[Echoing]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.35,0:41:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We all have a power,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.52,0:41:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and it grows when it is shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.61,0:41:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what you've learned, Crysta.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.48,0:42:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Crysta's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.83,0:42:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.06,0:42:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, Zak.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.85,0:42:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Hexxus can never harm \NFernGully again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.56,0:42:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But humans still could.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.57,0:42:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.86,0:43:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a part of me \Nthat really wants to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.99,0:43:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a part of you \Nthat will always stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.04,0:43:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Zak.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.55,0:43:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.23,0:43:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the stereo, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.40,0:43:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thanks, dude. \N- Hey, he's not going already?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.36,0:43:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.37,0:43:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- He just needed wings. \N- What was done, now undo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.25,0:43:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Return you to the form...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.21,0:43:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.71,0:43:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Good-bye, Zak.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.76,0:44:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.77,0:44:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Batty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.11,0:44:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[Gasps] I've shrunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.95,0:44:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Zak! \N- What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.81,0:44:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I will remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.06,0:44:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, things have gotta change.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.44,0:45:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[Magi's Voice] Crysta, help it grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.12,0:46:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.79,0:47:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ You fell through a tunnel ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.67,0:47:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Solid walls \Nshould be broken down ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.67,0:47:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,♪And you can't see \Nthe field of grain ♪
