Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.65,0:47:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ You'll destroy all the love \Nthat's been created ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.82,0:47:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Feeding mouths \Nwith an empty hand ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.78,0:47:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,♪And it's all such a simple thing \NChangin' everything ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.49,0:47:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,♪Listening to the one who \Nbrings all this love to you ♪
